WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.300
Welcome back to Building
HR-Driven Identity.

2
00:00:03.300 --> 00:00:07.337
This is Chapter 5: certificate-based
authentication checks.

3
00:00:07.337 --> 00:00:10.447
A revoked card is only
revoked if Entra can

4
00:00:10.447 --> 00:00:14.000
download the list that says
so, in time, every time.

5
00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:18.338
So this chapter checks the configuration
behind card sign-in as code.

6
00:00:18.338 --> 00:00:23.897
It starts from Learn's certificate revocation
list page and the Graph resources that

7
00:00:23.897 --> 00:00:27.342
hold the trust store and the
X.509 certificate method,

8
00:00:27.342 --> 00:00:32.275
and adds what they leave to you: a
measurement of every CRL, and thirteen rules.

9
00:00:32.275 --> 00:00:37.340
We'll see why, what the code does,
who runs it, two labs and the dangers.
